/docs/screenshots/

# Local development documentation and QA helpers are not part of the
# minimal public GitHub build tree. The private local master may already
# track some of these; the GitHub publication uses a strict allowlist.
/docs/
/scripts/apply-local-release-update.ps1
/scripts/smoke-release.ps1
/scripts/test-package-verify.ps1

# OS cruft
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
